### Authentication API Tests
### Use these with VS Code REST Client extension

### =============================================================================
### MANUAL REGISTRATION
### =============================================================================

POST http://localhost:8000/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "admin123",
  "name": "Admin User",
  "role": "admin"
}

###

POST http://localhost:8000/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "user123",
  "name": "Regular User",
  "role": "user"
}

### =============================================================================
### MANUAL LOGIN
### =============================================================================

POST http://localhost:8000/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### =============================================================================
### GET USER PROFILE
### =============================================================================

GET http://localhost:8000/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJhZG1pbkBleGFtcGxlLmNvbSIsImV4cCI6MTc2MjQ0NjQwMH0.test_signature

